      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest. i guess. but it doesn't feel like resting. it feels like i've just been erased. like everything that made me \"me\" was tied up in taking care of him. without that, there isn't even a person underneath. just this hollow feeling that won't go away. how am i even supposed to exist when there's nothing to exist for?",
